repository-code: "https://github.com/mahdisadeghiha/GeoAI"
abstract: >-
  A geospatial research prototype for detecting, quantifying, and mapping
  urban growth, built-up change, and vegetation dynamics from multi-temporal
  Sentinel-2 imagery, with a current case study focused on Muscat and Oman.
keywords:
  - urban planning
  - geospatial analysis
  - remote sensing
  - Sentinel-2
  - urban change detection
  - GIS
  - spatial analysis
